{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリクラの落書きコーナーではしゃぐ私達"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年ということもあって話しやすくて楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オムライスを食べに行ったんですけど\n悲しいことがありまして。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"店員さんに注文する時もなかなか気づいてもらえず...二人で首を長くしてキョロキョロしてました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お会計の時もレジで待っててもなかなか気づいてもらえなかったです..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでかな。梅ちゃん背高いのに..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また遊ぼうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前(沈金の金曜日)にかなりんとアルピーさんのラジオにじゅんなと2人出させていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのおかげですごく喋りやすい雰囲気でとっても楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何を言ってもアルピーさんが面白さに変えてくれて凄いなーって思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんのラップ？みたいなのもうらできいてたんですけど\n普通にラップがスッスッゴイヤァ！！！！\nって思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンケートありがとうございました。\n観覧にも来ていただいて嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも距離が近くてビックリ！！\nひとりひとりはっきりみえました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また遊びに行きたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今夜はTHE魂！大好きなみなみと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも見かけると「まあや〜♡」ってくるみなみが可愛くて可愛くて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"25日はオールナイトニッポン０の生放送のラジオにも出させていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校卒業してこうして夜のラジオに出させて頂くことが出来て大人になったんだな〜と実感してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばるぞー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ˘ω˘ ) ｽﾔｧ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂工事中に来週の京都個別握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/22/4405592/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしみっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/